{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KARMx takes place in a lovecraftian medieval fantasy world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KARMx is a runtime level editor and a collection of custom maps independant from each other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay is focused on (per-level) shooting, exploring areas and discovering secrets. You don't have global progression or explicit story. This game is heavily focused on environmental storytelling and level design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can build your own levels and share it as a single file.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859900?t=1754215580","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859900/fa5d20e3da0a3a83f148620fcfe382bc0f4b854c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754215580","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859900/8b9806050c7c1950be935315a8818a08a7dc51db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754215580","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859900/8b9806050c7c1950be935315a8818a08a7dc51db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754215580","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KARMx takes place in a lovecraftian medieval fantasy world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KARMx is a runtime level editor and a colle